<% content_for :title,'抢先试吃' %><section class="trial-page-heading"><span class="trial-stamp">先吃<br>为敬</span><div><h1>新出土的，先尝一口</h1><p>优先邀请主动参加的群，每次只选一小部分。无反馈不等于不好吃。</p><div class="reaction-key"><span>💩 好屎</span><span>😂 有节目效果</span><span>🥱 有点水</span></div></div></section><div class="trial-grid"><% @runs.each do |run| %><article class="trial-card"><div class="accession"><%= link_to run.shit_entry.sid,entry_path(run.shit_entry),class:'mono' %><span class="badge <%= run.status=='running' ? 'level-trial' : '' %>"><%= {'pending'=>'等待席位','running'=>'观察中','finished'=>'已结算'}.fetch(run.status,run.status) %></span></div><h2><%= link_to run.shit_entry.display_title,trial_path(run) %></h2><p><%= run.trial_deliveries.count %> 个试吃群 · <%= museum_date(run.started_at || run.created_at) %></p><% if run.trial_result %><%= render 'result',result:run.trial_result %><% else %><div class="awaiting-feedback">等待自然发生的反馈<small>观察截止 <%= museum_time(run.ends_at) %></small></div><% end %><%= link_to '打开本轮试吃 →',trial_path(run),class:'text-link' %></article><% end %></div><%= empty_state('还没有进行中的试吃。') if @runs.empty? %>
